From 4f6e223fe846a02f63c90eeb01b35af4690ac73f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 06:14:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): a body mention of the MacBook is not a
 local-only need [daveey]

A core-code card that only names the MacBook as a verification step was
pinned to this machine, and the creator could not see why or archive the
copy. Host-name markers now scan the title only. A marker-local create
result includes placement and the remedy. A worker may archive an
unclaimed card its own task created.
